	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(1458.4285714285716, 54.682539682539755, 300.0, 460.0)">AUC:
How well the model distinguishes different classes; higher is better

CA:
Classification accuracy (točnost klasifikacije)

F1:
Combines precision and recall into one score

Prec:
Precision (natančnost): how often predicted class memberships are correct

Recall:
Recall (priklic): how many actual members of each class were identified

MCC:
A measure of agreement between predicted and actual classes
</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/markdown" rect="(1468.4444444444443, -202.55555555555554, 300.0, 150.0)">Primerjalna tabela modelov ocenjuje verjetnost, da je en algoritem strojnega učenja uspešnejši od drugega glede na izbrano metriko. V našem primeru ima KNN ocenjeno 73,5% verjetnost, da doseže višjo vrednost AUC kot naivni Bayes.</text>
	</annotations>
